# ── test scaffolding — never commit these ───────────────────────────────────
# Throwaway DSH homes and LibreOffice profiles used while developing. They can
# contain copies of the user's settings and credentials, so they are ignored by
# PATTERN rather than by exact name: a new one created while testing is covered
# automatically instead of waiting for someone to remember.
.dsh-sdk/
*-testdsh/
*-testhome/
.setuptest*/
.curltest*/
.curltest-real/
.neutral/
research/poc/

# ── research scratch ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Downloaded pages, screenshots, and extracted third-party reference files.
# Deliberately kept out of the repository: some of it is other projects' code.
.research-scratch/

# ── build output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.oxt
*.log

# ── python ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# ── editors and OS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
